sam3-mac

This repository is an unofficial macOS porting fork of Meta's SAM 3 source:

  https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam3

Upstream baseline:

  5dd401d1c5c1d5c3eedff06d41b77af824517619

The fork adds macOS CPU compatibility changes, dependency locking, and a
text-prompt segmentation CLI. The mps branch additionally contains experimental
Apple MPS support.

Original authorship and copyright notices are retained in the source tree.
